"Chemical Engineering (ChE) is a well-recognised branch of engineering that applies the core scientific principles from chemistry, physics, and engineering to transform raw materials into valuable products. The ChE programme at XMUM is accredited by the Engineering Accreditation Council (EAC) Malaysia and features state-of-the-art chemical engineering laboratories and a Simulation Integrated Process Plant (SIPP), the first teaching-focused simulated process plant in Malaysia. The programme also incorporates elements of Artificial Intelligence and Industrial Revolution 4.0 (IR 4.0), and green and sustainable practices into its curriculum.":"化学工程（ChE）是一门广受认可的工程分支，运用化学、物理和工程的核心科学原理，将原材料转化为有价值的产品。XMUM 的化学工程课程获马来西亚工程认证委员会（EAC）认证，并设有先进的化学工程实验室及模拟集成工艺厂（SIPP），这是马来西亚首座以教学为主的模拟工艺厂。课程还将人工智能、第四次工业革命（IR 4.0）以及绿色与可持续实践等元素融入课程内容。",
