"Electrical and Electronic Engineering (EEE) is one of the fastest growing engineering branches that underpins the technological advancements of today and tomorrow. The Master of Science in Electrical and Electronic Engineering at Xiamen University Malaysia (XMUM) aims to help students in becoming professionals with profound ability to spearhead and facilitate the development in the electrical and electronic sectors on the national and international fronts. This programme is offered under the School of Artificial Intelligence and Robotics (SAIR) of XMUM, and also focuses on instilling skillsets crucial across the fields of EEE, including cognitive, practical, digital, numerical, personal and interpersonal, entrepreneurial, leadership, ethics and professionalism skills.":"电气与电子工程（EEE）是发展最快的工程分支之一，支撑着当今与未来的科技进步。厦门大学马来西亚分校（XMUM）的电气与电子工程理学硕士课程旨在帮助学生成为具备深厚能力的专业人才，在国内及国际层面引领并推动电气与电子领域的发展。本课程由 XMUM 人工智能与机器人学院（SAIR）开办，同时着重培养电气与电子工程各领域的关键技能，包括认知、实践、数字、数理、个人与人际、创业、领导、道德及专业素养等技能。",
"Electrical and Electronic Technology":"电工电子技术",
"Electrical and Electronics (EE) Engineering is one of the fastest growing branches of engineering that greatly impacts the modern society, encompassing specializations such as electrical power generation, electronic design, computer modelling, telecommunications, electro-magnetics, information technology and expert systems. The programme equips graduates with expertise and skills to perform professional roles in the field of electrical and electronic engineering, and to apply innovative and pioneering approaches to develop new products and technologies. The E&E programme at XMUM is mainly supported by the School of Information Science and Technology and the School of Aerospace Engineering of Xiamen University.":"电气与电子（EE）工程是发展最快的工程分支之一，对现代社会影响深远，涵盖发电、电子设计、计算机建模、电信、电磁学、资讯科技及专家系统等专业方向。本课程使毕业生具备在电气与电子工程领域担任专业角色的专业知识与技能，并能运用创新及开创性方法开发新产品与新技术。XMUM 的电气与电子（E&E）课程主要由厦门大学信息学院（School of Information Science and Technology）及航空航天学院提供支持。",
