"In Xiamen University Malaysia (XMUM), the Master in New Energy Science and Engineering is a full research mode programme offered with the focus of energy related disciplines such as energy novel materials design, optimization and applications. It is designed to develop an in-depth understanding of recent developments in emerging energy materials and their applications, in disciplines including catalysis, solar energy, electrochemical energy storage, piezoelectric energy, energy materials simulation, wave energy, petroleum chemical energy, and renewable and sustainable energy research. The programme provides practical training in an array of energy technology modules, such as energy materials/devices fabrication and materials characterization techniques, with access to fully-equipped modern research laboratories.":"厦门大学马来西亚分校（XMUM）的新能源科学与工程硕士是一项全研究模式课程，着重于能源相关学科，如新型能源材料的设计、优化与应用。课程旨在让学生深入了解新兴能源材料及其应用的最新发展，涵盖催化、太阳能、电化学储能、压电能、能源材料模拟、波浪能、石油化学能以及可再生与可持续能源研究等学科。课程提供一系列能源技术模块的实践训练，如能源材料/器件制备及材料表征技术，并可使用设备齐全的现代化研究实验室。",
"In Xiamen University Malaysia (XMUM), the PhD in New Energy Science and Engineering offers research topics with the focus of energy related disciplines such as energy novel materials design, optimization and applications. It is designed to develop an in-depth understanding of recent developments in emerging energy materials and their applications, in disciplines including catalysis, solar energy, electrochemical energy storage, piezoelectric energy, energy materials simulation, wave energy, petroleum chemical energy, and renewable and sustainable energy research. The programme provides practical training in an array of energy technology modules, such as energy materials/devices fabrication and materials characterization techniques, with access to fully-equipped modern research laboratories.":"厦门大学马来西亚分校（XMUM）的新能源科学与工程博士课程提供以能源相关学科为重点的研究课题，如新型能源材料的设计、优化与应用。课程旨在让学生深入了解新兴能源材料及其应用的最新发展，涵盖催化、太阳能、电化学储能、压电能、能源材料模拟、波浪能、石油化学能以及可再生与可持续能源研究等学科。课程提供一系列能源技术模块的实践训练，如能源材料/器件制备及材料表征技术，并可使用设备齐全的现代化研究实验室。",
