"Our Journalism programme has a proud history that dates back to 1922, when Xiamen University first introduced its Journalism studies. At XMUM, the programme is designed to provide a balanced blend of academic knowledge and hands-on-experience, equipping students with a well-rounded understanding of the media's role in society and the challenges of international and cross-cultural communication. The curriculum covers essential skills in journalistic reporting, storytelling, broadcast journalism, and production techniques, and aims to develop students' professional ethics, critical thinking, and sense of social responsibility.":"我们的新闻学课程历史悠久，可追溯至1922年，当时 厦门大学 首次开办新闻学教育。在 XMUM，本课程旨在平衡结合学术知识与实践经验，使学生全面了解媒体在社会中的角色，以及国际与跨文化传播所面临的挑战。课程涵盖新闻报道、叙事、广播新闻及制作技术等核心技能，并致力于培养学生的职业道德、批判性思维与社会责任感。",
