"Physics is a fundamental field of knowledge that intersects with other sciences and engineering. The aim of the department's graduate programme is to produce competent graduates with advanced knowledge and skills in physics beyond the undergraduate level. By engaging in a research-oriented PhD programme with academic staff from diverse fields, graduates will acquire the skills necessary for fundamental sciences research as well as various applied and engineering sciences, and will be able to participate in the worldwide physics community.":"物理学是一门与其他科学及工程学相交汇的基础知识领域。本系研究生课程旨在培养具备超越本科程度的物理学进阶知识与技能的优秀毕业生。通过与来自不同领域的学术人员一同参与以研究为导向的博士课程，毕业生将掌握从事基础科学研究以及各类应用科学与工程科学所需的技能，并能参与全球物理学界的活动。",
