"Science and technology are at the forefront of driving the progress and development as well as the competitiveness of a country. At Xiamen University Malaysia (XMUM), we are committed to attracting young people to science and technology by offering them an alternative route to undergraduate studies via a pre-university study programme in science. A seamless progression to an undergraduate programme of study at XMUM in a relevant field awaits them upon the successful completion of their XMUM foundation programme.":"科学与技术是推动国家进步与发展及提升国家竞争力的前沿力量。在 厦门大学马来西亚分校 (XMUM)，我们致力于吸引年轻人投身科学与技术，通过理科大学先修课程为他们提供另一条升读本科的途径。成功完成 XMUM 预科课程后，他们可无缝衔接 XMUM 相关领域的本科课程。",
