"With the growing adoption of digitalisation and automation, the demand for skilled workers in the area of information technology is set to increase over time. Xiamen University Malaysia has tailor-made a pre-university level programme, targeted at secondary school leavers irrespective of their educational streams who set their sights on pursuing an undergraduate qualification in the field of information technology.":"随着数字化与自动化日益普及，信息技术领域对技术人才的需求将持续增长。厦门大学马来西亚分校 为有志于攻读信息技术领域本科学位的中学毕业生量身打造了大学先修课程，不论其原本就读何种教育源流。",
"Writer and editor for publishing":"出版业作家及编辑",
"XML Design Technology":"XML 设计技术",
"XMU's Chinese Studies was accorded the 'National Talents Training and Research Base for Fundamental Studies in Humanities' and 'National Quality Courses' provider by China's Ministry of Education.":"XMU 中国语言文学专业获中国教育部授予“国家文科基础学科人才培养和科学研究基地”及“国家精品课程”。",
"XMUM is an Affiliated University of the CFA Institute; the programme is in the CFA University Affiliation Program (UAP).":"XMUM 是 CFA 协会的联盟大学；本课程属于 CFA 大学联盟计划（UAP）。",
"Xiamen University (XMU) began its marine studies nearly a century ago and is widely recognised as the cradle of China's marine sciences; with its backing, the China-ASEAN College of Marine Sciences (CAMS) was established at XMUM as the first overseas college of marine sciences. Recognising a growing demand for skilled professionals in marine environmental monitoring and management, the Marine Environmental Chemistry (MEC) programme equips students with the knowledge and skills needed to contribute to the sustainable management of marine resources and ecosystems. Students develop expertise in the sustainable utilisation of marine resources, cultivate strong environmental awareness, and graduate well-prepared for postgraduate study at XMU or other leading institutions worldwide.":"厦门大学 (XMU) 近一个世纪前便开展海洋研究，被广泛誉为中国海洋科学的摇篮；在其支持下，中国—东盟海洋学院（CAMS）在 XMUM 成立，成为首个海外海洋科学学院。鉴于海洋环境监测与管理领域对专业人才的需求日益增长，海洋环境化学（MEC）课程使学生掌握所需的知识与技能，为海洋资源与生态系统的可持续管理作出贡献。学生将培养海洋资源可持续利用方面的专业能力及强烈的环保意识，毕业后可充分准备在 XMU 或全球其他顶尖院校攻读研究生课程。",
"Xiamen University (XMU) started marine studies almost 100 years ago and is recognised as the cradle of China's marine studies. Marine Biotechnology was set as the pioneer programme in the China-ASEAN College of Marine Sciences, Xiamen University Malaysia, where students benefit from learning from experts in both Malaysia and China campus throughout the study. The programme equips graduates with the necessary knowledge and skills to manage the capitalisation of aquatic resources through ecologically friendly methods of aquaculture production, as well as to conduct research on marine biological resources, fisheries, aquaculture, and many other biotechnology related techniques.":"厦门大学 (XMU) 早在近100年前便开展海洋研究，被誉为中国海洋学科的摇篮。海洋生物技术是 厦门大学马来西亚分校 中国—东盟海洋学院的首个开办课程，学生在整个学习期间可受益于马来西亚及中国校区专家的指导。本课程使毕业生掌握所需的知识与技能，通过生态友好的水产养殖生产方式管理水产资源的开发利用，并开展海洋生物资源、渔业、水产养殖及多种生物技术相关技术的研究。",
"Xiamen University Malaysia":"厦门大学马来西亚分校",
"Xiamen University is the pioneer of education for the field of advertising in China, since starting in 1983. The programme provides a comprehensive exploration of advertising, public relations, integrated marketing communications, branding, digital marketing, strategic communications, event management and other practical courses. Students learn to combine critical and strategic thinking with research and creativity to deliver effective messages to a targeted audience on behalf of a client, and can specialise in either the creative or the account management side of the business after developing a foundation in both areas.":"厦门大学自1983年起开办广告学专业，是中国广告学教育的先驱。本课程全面探讨广告、公共关系、整合营销传播、品牌、数字营销、战略传播、活动管理及其他实务课程。学生学习将批判性与战略性思维同研究和创意相结合，代表客户向目标受众传递有效信息；在打好两方面的基础后，可选择专攻业务中的创意方向或客户管理方向。",
