"• A Bachelor's Degree in related science or engineering discipline with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 but below 2.75 will be subjected to internal assessment; OR":"• 拥有相关理科或工程学科的学士学位，CGPA 至少 2.50 但低于 2.75，须经内部评估；或",
"• A Bachelor's Degree in related science or engineering discipline with a minimum CGPA of 2.75; OR":"• 拥有相关理科或工程学科的学士学位，CGPA 至少 2.75；或",
"• A Bachelor's degree (Level 6, MQF) in Computing or related fields with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 and not meeting a CGPA of 3.00 can be accepted subject to a thorough rigorous assessment as determined by the HEP; OR":"• 拥有计算机或相关领域的学士学位（MQF 第 6 级），CGPA 至少 2.00 但未达 3.00，须经高等教育机构（HEP）决定的全面严格评估方可被录取；或",
"• A Bachelor's degree (Level 6, MQF) in Computing or related fields with a minimum CGPA of 3.00 or equivalent, as accepted by the HEP Senate OR":"• 拥有计算机或相关领域的学士学位（MQF 第 6 级），CGPA 至少 3.00 或同等成绩，并获高等教育机构（HEP）校务委员会（Senate）接受；或",
"• A Bachelor's degree (Level 6, MQF) in Non-Computing field with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 can be accepted subject to a thorough rigorous assessment as determined by the HEP to identify the appropriate prerequisite courses that equivalent to their working experience in the Computing or related fields; OR":"• 拥有非计算机领域的学士学位（MQF 第 6 级），CGPA 至少 2.50，须经高等教育机构（HEP）决定的全面严格评估，以确定与其在计算机或相关领域工作经验相当的适当先修课程，方可被录取；或",
"• A Bachelor's degree (Level 6, MQF) in Non-Computing field with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 can be accepted subject to appropriate prerequisite courses; OR":"• 拥有非计算机领域的学士学位（MQF 第 6 级），CGPA 至少 2.50，须修读适当的先修课程方可被录取；或",
"• A Bachelor's degree with the following conditions: a) A Bachelor's degree in Physics or related fields with a first-class distinction (CGPA of 3.67 or higher) or its equivalent from an academic or TVET programme; b) Undergo internal assessment, and c) Any other requirements of the HEP":"• 拥有学士学位并符合以下条件：a) 拥有物理或相关领域的一等荣誉学士学位（CGPA 3.67 或以上），或来自学术或 TVET 课程的同等学历；b) 通过内部评估；以及 c) 符合高等教育机构（HEP）的任何其他要求",
"• A Diploma (Level 4, MQF) with a minimum CGPA of 2.00 or its equivalent and a credit in English in SPM or its equivalent":"• 文凭（MQF 第 4 级）CGPA 至少 2.00 或同等资格，且 SPM 或同等学历英文考获优等",
"• A Master's Degree in Mathematical Sciences; or":"• 拥有数学科学硕士学位；或",
"• A Master's Degree in related science or engineering discipline; OR":"• 拥有相关理科或工程学科的硕士学位；或",
"• A Master's degree (Level 7, MQF) in non-computing fields with a minimum of FIVE (5) years of working experience in the field of computing or related fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses as determined by the HEP; OR":"• 拥有非计算机领域的硕士学位（MQF 第 7 级），并在计算机或相关领域具备至少五（5）年工作经验，须修读高等教育机构（HEP）指定的适当先修课程；或",
"• A Master's degree (Level 7, MQF) in non-computing fields with less than FIVE (5) years of working experience in the field of computing or related fields must undergo appropriate prerequisite courses as determined by the HEP and subject to rigorous internal assessment; OR":"• 拥有非计算机领域的硕士学位（MQF 第 7 级），在计算机或相关领域的工作经验少于五（5）年，须修读高等教育机构（HEP）指定的适当先修课程并经严格的内部评估；或",
"• A Master's degree (Level 7, MQF) in the field of Computing or related fields as accepted by the HEP Senate; OR":"• 拥有计算机或相关领域的硕士学位（MQF 第 7 级），并获高等教育机构（HEP）校务委员会（Senate）接受；或",
"• A Masters' degree in Physics or related fields accepted by the HEP senate; or":"• 拥有物理或相关领域的硕士学位，并获高等教育机构（HEP）校务委员会（Senate）接受；或",
"• A bachelor's degree (Level 6, MQF) in Marine Biotechnology or Marine Science or Biotechnology or any other relevant field with minimum CGPA of 2.00 and not meeting CGPA of 2.50, can be accepted subject to a minimum of 5 years working experience in any relevant field and internal assessment.":"• 拥有海洋生物技术、海洋科学、生物技术或任何其他相关领域的学士学位（MQF 第 6 级），CGPA 至少 2.00 但未达 2.50，须具备至少 5 年相关领域工作经验并经内部评估方可被录取。",
"• A bachelor's degree (Level 6, MQF) in Marine Biotechnology or Marine Science or Biotechnology or any other relevant field with minimum CGPA of 2.50 and not meeting CGPA of 2.75, can be accepted subject to internal assessment; or":"• 拥有海洋生物技术、海洋科学、生物技术或任何其他相关领域的学士学位（MQF 第 6 级），CGPA 至少 2.50 但未达 2.75，须经内部评估方可被录取；或",
