"• A bachelor's degree in Engineering or Other Sciences with a minimum CGPA of 2.75, with at least grade B (Grade Point 3.00) in Calculus I (Single Variable Calculus), Calculus II (Multivariable Calculus) and Linear Algebra; or":"• 拥有工程或其他理科学士学位，CGPA 至少 2.75，且微积分 I（单变量微积分）、微积分 II（多变量微积分）及线性代数至少获 B 级（绩点 3.00）；或",
"• A bachelor's degree in Engineering with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 or the equivalent":"• 拥有工程学士学位，CGPA 至少 2.50 或同等成绩",
"• A bachelor's degree in Mathematical Sciences with a minimum CGPA of 2.50 or the equivalent; or":"• 拥有数学科学学士学位，CGPA 至少 2.50 或同等成绩；或",
